      "text": "Project name The Luxe: seven-level condominium building with eight stacked residential levels of 15 units each over street-level commercial, three levels of underground parking, a roof-level eating establishment and a 7,121 sq ft public plaza; 146 ft 6 in overall height; 306,252 total sq ft.",
